,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110048","id":3234042730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Aw5Nq","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T15:47:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T15:47:54Z","body":"Yeah, I guess this is related to how long copying each file takes.\n\nI'm not familiar with the filesystem. But I did a quick test and this `if` statement fails for all files to be copied expect the first one (the one displayed). The block seems to be responsible for collecting new files in the directory.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4ebf67c12dcdffcb69242569c118a371a654b6ae/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1411-L1412","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3234042730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239104996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110048#issuecomment-3239104996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110048","id":3239104996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BENHk","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T08:39:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T11:29:13Z","body":"It seems that `EditorFileSystem::update_file()` is not called for some (imported resource) files.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239104996/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239276942","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110048#issuecomment-3239276942","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110048","id":3239276942,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BE3GO","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-30T13:46:29Z","updated_at":"2025-08-30T13:58:17Z","body":"It seems that the timestamp precision (the current precision is 1 **second**) is not enough to detect file changes.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/825ef2387f87de1c350696886e6c50b039204cef/drivers/unix/file_access_unix.cpp#L361-L367\n\nhttps://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/stat.3type.html\n\nhttps://man7.org/linux/man-pages/man3/timespec.3type.html\n\nIf the files are created within the same second.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4ebf67c12dcdffcb69242569c118a371a654b6ae/editor/file_system/editor_file_system.cpp#L1411-L1413\n\nThe directory is scanned only when the first file is copied. The directory timestamps are not changed on subsequent file copies (copies occur in the same second). It will skip the if block.\n\nMaybe `_scan_fs_changes()` should be called after all files have finished copying.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3239276942/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]